i) The applicant will comply with all the terms and conditions of the bond executed by him/her;
NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025:MPHC-GWL:20733 3 MCRC-14547-2025 ii) The applicant will cooperate in the investigation /trial, as the case may be;
